- Supports AES-256-CBC and AES-128-GCM modes, selectable at runtime.
- Encryption and decryption functions handle both modes.
- Context management ensures clean initialization and cleanup.

This code provides a flexible foundation for cryptographic operations while ensuring efficient memory handling.']

